    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"the world waiting for me to step out\" ... that's a weird way to put it. but i guess it feels like that. like everything here is just a ghost of what it used to be. i look at his side of the bed and it just feels so empty i can't even breathe. i just want the pain to stop. i just want to be where he is.",
